...let down your hair.

00:16:06.900 --> 00:16:09.340
You've gotta be kiddin' me, you...

00:16:09.340 --> 00:16:12.410
We're not kiddin'. We're 
like, totally for reals.

00:16:12.410 --> 00:16:16.660
We ain't gonna let anyone 
drag Madame Aoi down...

00:16:21.990 --> 00:16:25.960
What are you staring at? 
Let's get practice started.

00:16:25.960 --> 00:16:28.270
No, uh...

00:16:28.540 --> 00:16:29.870
Who might you be?

00:16:29.870 --> 00:16:31.470
It's me, Himekawa.

00:16:31.470 --> 00:16:33.380
I'm the Himekawa-san you know and love!

00:16:33.380 --> 00:16:35.320
Can't you tell by looking at me?!

00:16:35.320 --> 00:16:39.100
No, we think you look like a 
completely different person.

00:16:39.610 --> 00:16:40.800
Um...

00:16:41.470 --> 00:16:45.000
While we have everyone together, 
let's decide on the positions.

00:16:45.000 --> 00:16:48.140
We need to take best advantage 
of everyone's strengths to win.

00:16:48.420 --> 00:16:52.670
Like, see, there's a position 
whose main job is receiving.

00:16:52.670 --> 00:16:53.610
Did you know?

00:16:53.610 --> 00:16:55.440
Huh, what's that?

00:16:55.440 --> 00:16:58.040
I don't like that sort of position.

00:16:58.040 --> 00:16:59.120
The libero, yes?

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:01.130
There's many restrictions,

00:17:01.130 --> 00:17:05.260
but they can sub for the back-row players 
anytime they want... A defensive specialist.

00:17:05.560 --> 00:17:08.000
The color of their uniform 
is also slightly different.

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:11.130
Something similar to the team's pivot...

00:17:11.130 --> 00:17:14.010
Team's... pivot?

00:17:14.010 --> 00:17:16.920
Hey, isn't that like a 
team captain or something?

00:17:16.920 --> 00:17:18.240
Then I'll do it.

00:17:18.240 --> 00:17:19.350
No, I'll do it.

00:17:19.350 --> 00:17:20.640
No, I will...

00:17:20.640 --> 00:17:21.120
No...

00:17:21.120 --> 00:17:23.980
But the libero isn't the captain.

00:17:23.980 --> 00:17:25.270
Me!

00:17:25.770 --> 00:17:27.870
I'll be the libero.

00:17:27.870 --> 00:17:30.860
You people don't understand anything, right?

00:17:30.860 --> 00:17:34.580
Come on, Kunieda. I didn't 
think you'd be so picky.

00:17:34.580 --> 00:17:36.550
You really wanna be captain that bad?

00:17:36.550 --> 00:17:38.270
That's not it, idiot.

00:17:38.270 --> 00:17:40.000
I'm trying to tell you, the libero isn't...

00:17:40.000 --> 00:17:40.870
Furuichi.

00:17:47.280 --> 00:17:48.960
I will decide.

00:17:50.860 --> 00:17:54.740
There's no going back now. Come play with me.

00:17:54.740 --> 00:17:57.290
That serve could kill!

00:17:57.290 --> 00:18:00.090
Whoa, the ball exploded!

00:18:00.090 --> 00:18:03.170
Whoever can return my serve is the libero.

00:18:03.170 --> 00:18:04.270
How about that?

00:18:06.140 --> 00:18:07.200
Fine.

00:18:07.200 --> 00:18:08.020
Madame Aoi!

00:18:11.260 --> 00:18:12.320
Get on with it.

00:18:12.320 --> 00:18:15.550
Oh? You'll do it?

00:18:15.550 --> 00:18:16.700
Interesting.

00:18:26.740 --> 00:18:27.830
A jump serve!

00:18:37.260 --> 00:18:38.550
Over already?

00:18:40.320 --> 00:18:42.350
That wasn't just fast...

00:18:42.810 --> 00:18:45.060
I couldn't see it at all!

00:18:46.260 --> 00:18:48.360
That serve was nuts!

00:18:48.360 --> 00:18:50.170
It buried itself into the wall!

00:18:50.170 --> 00:18:52.820
There's no way a human could do that!

00:18:52.820 --> 00:18:55.320
Well, she ain't a human...

00:18:55.320 --> 00:18:57.320
Could you see her panties just now?

00:18:58.200 --> 00:19:00.280
There's no way to return that!

00:19:00.650 --> 00:19:02.930
You could see her panties, right?

00:19:02.930 --> 00:19:03.830
Go to sleep.

00:19:06.570 --> 00:19:08.210
One more!

00:19:11.010 --> 00:19:13.960
Please, serve to me again.

00:19:14.900 --> 00:19:16.210
As you wish.

00:19:16.790 --> 00:19:19.950
Seeing the ball's path with 
my eyes will be too late.

00:19:20.320 --> 00:19:24.240
The crucial thing is the timing and 
predicting its path the instant she shoots!

00:19:24.470 --> 00:19:25.850
Nene!

00:19:25.850 --> 00:19:26.600
Yes?

00:19:27.080 --> 00:19:28.350
Let me borrow your hair tie.

00:19:35.820 --> 00:19:36.470
Thank you.

00:19:39.400 --> 00:19:40.490
Moe...

00:19:44.240 --> 00:19:48.250
Next is sound, presence, 
the flow of the air...

00:19:48.250 --> 00:19:49.530
Here I go.

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:54.000
Sense them with my skin...

00:19:54.000 --> 00:19:57.710
Look at that! Oga's wife jumped 
twice as high this time!

00:19:58.970 --> 00:20:01.220
I do this all the time!

00:20:15.010 --> 00:20:17.020
S-She returned it!

00:20:17.020 --> 00:20:19.440
And she did it right up against the net!

00:20:19.440 --> 00:20:21.890
Chills up my spine, Madame Aoi!

00:20:21.890 --> 00:20:22.950
You did it!

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:28.130
Now then, shall we restart practice?

00:20:31.710 --> 00:20:34.620
What're you doing? Let's get started.

00:20:34.620 --> 00:20:38.030
Guess we'll let you be captain.

00:20:38.740 --> 00:20:39.710
Libero.

00:20:39.710 --> 00:20:43.470
Well, I was always more suited for spiking.

00:20:43.470 --> 00:20:46.970
By the way, Kunieda-senpai... 
Are your arms okay?

00:20:47.220 --> 00:20:48.850
I've gotten tired of waiting.

00:20:51.570 --> 00:20:52.990
There you have it.

00:20:53.600 --> 00:20:56.350
You are the libero and captain.

00:20:57.110 --> 00:20:59.380
All in one person.

00:20:59.750 --> 00:21:04.360
She... Did she plan on this from the start?

00:21:05.740 --> 00:21:07.420
Here we go!

00:21:07.420 --> 00:21:10.700
This is lookin' pretty good, actually...

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:11.750
Wait!

00:21:11.750 --> 00:21:15.620
You weren't the only ones 
beaten by the 6 Holy Knights!

00:21:16.270 --> 00:21:19.380
MK-5 + 1!

00:21:19.380 --> 00:21:21.780
They show up, now?

00:21:21.780 --> 00:21:24.880
Look at 'em! They've got matching uniforms!

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:26.510
They're experts at pissin' me off!

00:21:27.250 --> 00:21:30.410
We heard it's a volleyball match.

00:21:30.410 --> 00:21:33.020
In that case, we'd be far more suited!

00:21:33.020 --> 00:21:34.020
Let's have a game!

00:21:34.500 --> 00:21:37.020
The winner gets to play the 6 Holy Knights.

00:21:37.670 --> 00:21:42.200
Do you really think we'll end 
up today like the usual gag?

00:21:42.200 --> 00:21:43.490
Yes!

00:21:43.490 --> 00:21:44.700
Actually!

00:21:44.700 --> 00:21:45.490
We!

00:21:45.530 --> 00:21:46.910
Do!

00:21:48.410 --> 00:21:50.160
<b>MK-5 + Shimokawa = Instant Loss</b>

00:21:53.080 --> 00:21:57.590
Well, at least they're all athletic.

00:21:59.500 --> 00:22:00.920
We can do this!

00:23:46.290 --> 00:23:48.990
Just a little longer...

00:24:01.960 --> 00:24:06.710
For a man, sometimes you may know you 
will lose, but still you must fight!

00:24:06.710 --> 00:24:08.630
What are you saying that all 
cool like for, Furuichi?

00:24:08.630 --> 00:24:12.630
And sometimes you have to set up the 
jokes, even though you know they'll bomb!

00:24:12.630 --> 00:24:14.070
Don't go making rationalizations!

00:24:14.070 --> 00:24:16.760
Anyway, make sure not to bomb there.

00:24:16.760 --> 00:24:20.430
On the next Beelzebub: There 
Are Wounds in the Past.

00:24:20.430 --> 00:24:21.640
Okay then, set me up for one!

00:24:22.220 --> 00:24:25.360
Did you say that a friend 
had wounds in his past?

00:24:25.360 --> 00:24:27.020
Do you think a kick would heel him?

00:24:27.020 --> 00:24:27.630
And the joke is?

00:24:27.630 --> 00:24:29.110
Uh...
